      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1305075758,
      "text": "Zingiber spectabile is a species of true ginger, native to Maritime Southeast Asia. It is primarily grown in the West as an ornamental plant, although it has been used in South-East Asia as a medicinal herb."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Zingiber spectabile",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zingiber_spectabile",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 171483256,
      "text": "Zingiber spectabile es una especie de jengibre verdadero, nativa del archipiélago malayo. Se cultiva principalmente en Occidente como planta ornamental, aunque se utiliza en el sudeste asiático como hierba medicinal."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Zingiber spectabile",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zingiber_spectabile",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 213243759,
      "text": "Zingiber spectabile est une plante herbacée du genre Zingiber de la famille des Zingiberacées, originaire des forêts humides de la Thaïlande à la Malaisie péninsulaire."
    }
